Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:04.19,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,Vaya, han pasado muchas cosas…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:07.63,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,Pero parece que todo\Nse ha resuelto por ahora.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.41,0:22:17.42,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,¡¿130.000 yenes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:19.96,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,Los ahorros que tanto me costó reunir…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:23.25,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,¡Viejo de mierda…!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.94,0:22:53.32,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:55.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.57,0:22:58.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:23:00.03,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:02.41,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.41,0:23:04.79,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.79,0:23:07.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:09.29,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.29,0:23:11.54,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.54,0:23:13.88,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:15.50,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:18.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.13,0:23:22.64,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:26.18,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
